1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
First Episode
The Princess Knight

15
00:02:25,541 --> 00:02:27,293


16
00:02:27,341 --> 00:02:30,014
Excuse me, ma'am, have you
by any chance seen a young girl...

17
00:02:30,061 --> 00:02:33,292
...with black hair and blue
eyes, dressed like a boy?

18
00:02:33,341 --> 00:02:35,172
I haven't seen any girl.

19
00:02:36,021 --> 00:02:40,340
Help! Help me! Get
me on my feet, please!

20
00:02:41,221 --> 00:02:42,453
Mrs. Ladybug, maybe
you can help me!

21
00:02:42,581 --> 00:02:46,261
Have you seen a young
girl dressed like a boy?

22
00:02:46,261 --> 00:02:49,180
I really haven't
seen a girl like that.
Well, see you later.

23
00:02:49,381 --> 00:02:52,738
I've been looking for her for
12 years now without finding her.

24
00:02:52,781 --> 00:02:55,420
Who knows how much
further I'll have to go...!

25
00:02:55,461 --> 00:02:57,736


26
00:02:58,101 --> 00:02:59,898


27
00:02:59,941 --> 00:03:02,136


28
00:03:02,181 --> 00:03:04,137


29
00:03:04,020 --> 00:03:05,981
Come on! I'm not afraid of you!

30
00:03:06,020 --> 00:03:09,010
Let's spray the
revealing liquid on him!

31
00:03:09,061 --> 00:03:09,881
What are you up to now?

32
00:03:09,955 --> 00:03:14,036
This!
Damn it, I missed him!
Let's all spray together!

33
00:03:14,061 --> 00:03:15,661
If she's a girl,
she'll change color!

34
00:03:16,252 --> 00:03:17,821
Come on, let's spray!

35
00:03:21,060 --> 00:03:23,891
- Run!
- Quick! - Let's follow him!

36
00:03:24,790 --> 00:03:27,332
Onward, gallop!

37
00:03:27,381 --> 00:03:30,817
Do you want to get your butt
off the ground? Walk, idiot!

38
00:03:46,461 --> 00:03:48,611


39
00:03:51,861 --> 00:03:54,056
- Where is that damn bastard?
- This way!

40
00:03:56,901 --> 00:03:58,892
No, not in the river!
Where is it less damp?

41
00:03:58,941 --> 00:04:01,375
Here or here? Here or here?
Here! No, here!

42
00:04:05,501 --> 00:04:08,741
Tell your master
not to have me chased anymore!

43
00:04:10,261 --> 00:04:11,819


44
00:04:37,821 --> 00:04:41,575
Prince Sapphire, wake up!
It's time to get up! Please!

45
00:04:41,694 --> 00:04:45,252
Help! Ghosts!
They have it out for me! Help!

46
00:04:47,700 --> 00:04:48,493
Good morning, Garigori.

47
00:04:48,541 --> 00:04:51,499
Look how much time you've wasted!
More than half a minute!

48
00:04:51,541 --> 00:04:54,260
Mr. Garigori,
I have been awake for a long time!

49
00:04:54,301 --> 00:04:57,700
So it's time to stop
teasing me!

50
00:04:58,381 --> 00:05:01,221
Good morning, Prince!
It's time to get dressed.

51
00:05:05,701 --> 00:05:08,621
I brought you
clothes suited to your rank.

52
00:05:08,901 --> 00:05:10,892
No! What are you doing, Prince?

53
00:05:10,941 --> 00:05:14,377
No! Stop, please, Prince!
Be good, please!

54
00:05:14,402 --> 00:05:16,016
You rascal!
Doing this to a woman like me.

55
00:05:16,041 --> 00:05:17,861
Where are you going, Prince? Stop!
Come here!

56
00:05:25,261 --> 00:05:27,695
Good morning, Opal!
Are you glad to see me?

57
00:05:29,021 --> 00:05:30,818
Now take my clothes

58
00:05:34,021 --> 00:05:37,170
I didn't feel like
wearing those clothes.

59
00:05:37,696 --> 00:05:39,396
I feel much better in mine.
Now I'm fine!

60
00:05:39,421 --> 00:05:40,900
See you later!

61
00:05:45,941 --> 00:05:47,533
Thank you, little horse!

62
00:06:02,581 --> 00:06:05,015
Greetings to you
and may heaven protect you,

63
00:06:05,061 --> 00:06:07,655
our lord
Sovereign of these lands!

64
00:06:07,701 --> 00:06:09,419
- Greetings!
- May the sun...

65
00:06:09,461 --> 00:06:12,658
...continue to shine
upon your fortunes, and may...

66
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:17,016
- It's the Prince!
- The black sheep of the realm!

67
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:19,177
The lord of the castle
of Silverland,

68
00:06:19,260 --> 00:06:21,411
grand knight of merit of the kingdom,

69
00:06:21,460 --> 00:06:24,100
the Grand Duke Duralumin!

70
00:06:25,500 --> 00:06:29,130
I am pleased to be in the presence
of your august person, Sire.

71
00:06:29,180 --> 00:06:31,172
I too am glad to see you.

72
00:06:31,220 --> 00:06:33,815
- But he sees the King every day!
- You little brat!

73
00:06:33,860 --> 00:06:36,819
I was thinking, regarding
the deer hunting contest,

74
00:06:36,860 --> 00:06:39,534
I want it to be grand
this year!

75
00:06:39,700 --> 00:06:41,896
But is there enough money
for the contest?

76
00:06:41,940 --> 00:06:44,011
Naturally,
it will require more taxes!

77
00:06:44,060 --> 00:06:47,292
I have already prepared the Royal Decree.
You need only sign, Sire.

78
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:49,736
Give the Grand Duke the Royal Seal!

79
00:06:49,780 --> 00:06:52,011
With it,
you can sign in my place.

80
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:56,616
- Take that!
- What was that?!

81
00:07:00,580 --> 00:07:02,731
I will return later.
Excuse me...

82
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:03,530


83
00:07:03,753 --> 00:07:05,061
Hi, dad!

84
00:07:07,002 --> 00:07:07,452
Sapphire!

85
00:07:07,875 --> 00:07:09,794
You must take off
your hat in the Throne Room!

86
00:07:11,113 --> 00:07:14,259
That's better! And why are you
dressed like a poor swordsman?

87
00:07:15,774 --> 00:07:16,592
I like this outfit.

88
00:07:16,917 --> 00:07:19,737
It suits me! I can't stand
those pompous clothes!

89
00:07:20,620 --> 00:07:23,215
Sapphire, remember that
you are the Crown Prince!

90
00:07:23,260 --> 00:07:25,013
You must behave with more dignity!

91
00:07:25,060 --> 00:07:28,735
How dare you address
me by only saying: "Hi, dad!

92
00:07:28,780 --> 00:07:30,931
" Why, dad? What else
was I supposed to say?

93
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:33,275
First of all, a bow was required.
What's there to laugh about?!

94
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:36,498
Oh, my goodness! I lost my balance!

95
00:07:38,086 --> 00:07:39,059
Duke Duralumin!

96
00:07:39,500 --> 00:07:41,749
Oh, good morning, Baron Nylon!
It is you!

97
00:07:41,774 --> 00:07:44,620
That brat of a Prince
prevented me from signing...

98
00:07:44,645 --> 00:07:47,016
...in place of the King, the Decree
that increases taxes on the people.

99
00:07:47,041 --> 00:07:49,017
We will teach him a lesson!
Listen, Grand Duke!

100
00:07:49,042 --> 00:07:51,097
I know how to get rid of
the little Prince.

101
00:07:51,122 --> 00:07:53,092
If it were known
that he is actually a girl

102
00:07:53,117 --> 00:07:55,018
he could never again
ascend the throne,

103
00:07:55,042 --> 00:07:57,700
because our law forbids
a woman from reigning as Queen.

104
00:07:57,725 --> 00:08:00,051
I will reveal the secret
and this country will be yours!

105
00:08:00,076 --> 00:08:02,296
If you do so,
you will have wealth and honors from me..

106
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:04,084
as soon as I am proclaimed King!

107
00:08:04,109 --> 00:08:06,955
A King must not yawn
in public!

108
00:08:06,980 --> 00:08:10,236
He must not even snicker,
cough, or laugh too much.

109
00:08:10,261 --> 00:08:13,618
He must dress with splendor, show himself
always benevolent and never angry,

110
00:08:13,643 --> 00:08:16,095
he cannot remain alone,
but must always be..

111
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,322
...accompanied and aided
by his vassals.

112
00:08:17,323 --> 00:08:18,215
Prince!

113
00:08:19,092 --> 00:08:21,396
What are you doing? You
shouldn't just look at the pictures!

114
00:08:21,421 --> 00:08:23,412
You must read, if you
want to learn something!

115
00:08:23,437 --> 00:08:25,895
When I was your age, I remember
that I studied very many treatises...

116
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,384
...and I read many more books
than you do!

117
00:08:27,409 --> 00:08:28,343
More than all of these?

118
00:08:28,368 --> 00:08:31,828
Yes, very many!
Hey, Prince, let me out!

119
00:08:31,853 --> 00:08:35,323
You brat, get me out!
Help! Help! Out! Out!

120
00:08:45,741 --> 00:08:46,941
Mother

121
00:08:47,538 --> 00:08:50,040
Sapphire, where are you going in such a hurry?

122
00:08:50,701 --> 00:08:52,796
Don't be naughty! Go back
to your rooms, you must study.

123
00:08:52,997 --> 00:08:54,453
I don't like studying, mother

124
00:08:54,477 --> 00:08:57,015
and I can't stand always being
around old people in the castle!

125
00:08:57,040 --> 00:08:59,097
Sapphire, you shouldn't
say such things!

126
00:08:59,141 --> 00:09:01,847
- I'm leaving! Bye, Mom!
- Sapphire!

127
00:09:01,872 --> 00:09:04,540
My poor little girl!
Where do you want to go?

128
00:09:04,581 --> 00:09:09,316
It is because of the law of this
kingdom that Sapphire is like this now.

129
00:09:09,341 --> 00:09:13,127
It was a season just like this
when she was born.

130
00:09:22,581 --> 00:09:25,015


131
00:09:34,266 --> 00:09:38,058
Rejoice, my loyal subjects!

132
00:09:38,083 --> 00:09:39,870
The long-awaited heir is born!
The Queen has given you a Prince!

133
00:09:39,895 --> 00:09:42,896


134
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:46,251
I have deceived my people.
I should have announced...

135
00:09:46,276 --> 00:09:49,179
...the birth of a little Princess,
not a little Prince!

136
00:09:49,221 --> 00:09:51,894
You did the right thing!
There was nothing else to be done.

137
00:09:51,919 --> 00:09:54,011
The law forbids a woman
to reign,

138
00:09:54,035 --> 00:09:56,859
so we must make everyone believe
that she is a boy.

139
00:09:56,884 --> 00:09:58,261
My heart breaks!

140
00:10:02,821 --> 00:10:06,063
Why did my husband
announce that she is a boy?

141
00:10:06,861 --> 00:10:08,922
The truth is, he had
no other choice!

142
00:10:08,947 --> 00:10:11,771
If anyone finds out
that a girl was born,

143
00:10:12,216 --> 00:10:13,252
it could be dangerous.

144
00:10:13,301 --> 00:10:15,926
The Grand Duke covets the throne.

145
00:10:15,951 --> 00:10:17,009
we cannot allow him
to seize it.

146
00:10:17,901 --> 00:10:20,492
Your Majesty, as the law demands,
it is time for the Grand Duke...

147
00:10:20,516 --> 00:10:22,916
...to pay homage
to His Highness the little Prince!

148
00:10:22,941 --> 00:10:26,221
Oh, heavens! Wait a
moment! We are not ready yet!

149
00:10:26,300 --> 00:10:28,780
You must show the little Prince!
Don't waste any more time!

150
00:10:28,805 --> 00:10:31,381
What can I do
so he doesn't discover the truth?

151
00:10:32,060 --> 00:10:33,473
Place next to her
a boy's toy.

152
00:10:33,498 --> 00:10:35,434
The Grand Duke will be deceived

153
00:10:36,061 --> 00:10:38,981
Grand Duke, you may enter
to observe His Highness the Little Prince!

154
00:10:39,301 --> 00:10:41,769


155
00:10:52,661 --> 00:10:56,415
I pay homage to His Highness and
wish him to grow up healthy and strong.

156
00:10:58,381 --> 00:11:01,339
In this way they managed
to deceive the Grand Duke..

157
00:11:01,381 --> 00:11:03,614
...and hide the truth
from the court and the people.

158
00:11:03,639 --> 00:11:05,768
From then on, Sapphire was raised
as a boy,

159
00:11:06,335 --> 00:11:09,989
with the complicity of the doctor,
the nurse, and the chamberlain.

160
00:11:14,376 --> 00:11:16,490
Seasons passed,
meanwhile, Sapphire grew up.

161
00:11:18,988 --> 00:11:21,353
She was only allowed games
typical of boys.

162
00:11:22,775 --> 00:11:24,966
The truth was
carefully kept hidden.

163
00:11:24,991 --> 00:11:28,635
Sapphire was slowly raised to
have the mindset of a boy.

164
00:11:40,536 --> 00:11:42,252
So that the kingdom would not fall
into the hands of the evil Grand Duke,

165
00:11:42,601 --> 00:11:45,545
Sapphire grew up without knowing
the small, great joys...

166
00:11:46,089 --> 00:11:50,971
...that bloom
in the female soul.

167
00:11:51,514 --> 00:11:56,189
Poor Sapphire!
How unhappy I feel for you!

168
00:12:21,581 --> 00:12:24,891
How are you, Prince? Are you taking
a solitary walk?

169
00:12:24,915 --> 00:12:27,901
Baron Nylon, I cannot feel
any pleasure in this meeting!

170
00:12:29,411 --> 00:12:31,226
I am sorry, Prince, to hear you
speak this way towards me.

171
00:12:31,251 --> 00:12:34,444
They say you are skilled in fencing. I
would like to measure myself against you.

172
00:12:34,878 --> 00:12:35,315
Fine!

173
00:12:35,339 --> 00:12:35,983


174
00:12:36,007 --> 00:12:37,290
On guard!

175
00:12:37,314 --> 00:12:39,314
Just the two of us!

176
00:12:41,501 --> 00:12:44,413


177
00:12:44,461 --> 00:12:46,292


178
00:12:46,781 --> 00:12:49,693


179
00:12:53,605 --> 00:12:55,336
You lost, it seems!

180
00:12:57,138 --> 00:12:58,780
Nylon do you want another round?

181
00:13:02,101 --> 00:13:04,388
What are you looking at?! I
will win the next contest: archery!

182
00:13:04,413 --> 00:13:05,628
Let's see if you are capable of doing it!

183
00:13:08,812 --> 00:13:09,695
Do you mean this?

184
00:13:13,430 --> 00:13:14,619
Do you like apples?

185
00:13:14,861 --> 00:13:16,658
I've got another idea
for another contest.

186
00:13:16,701 --> 00:13:19,499
An embroidery contest! Whoever makes it
the most beautiful and in the shortest time wins!

187
00:13:19,666 --> 00:13:21,771
How dare you? How
dare you challenge me...

188
00:13:21,821 --> 00:13:24,425
...to a contest in which I'd have
to perform such feminine work?!

189
00:13:24,450 --> 00:13:27,334
Rather, now you will tell me
why you had me followed...

190
00:13:27,381 --> 00:13:28,780
...by your men over
these last few days!

191
00:13:29,253 --> 00:13:31,013
But what are you talking
about? I know nothing!

192
00:13:31,949 --> 00:13:34,098
You are a schemer! Now
get out and leave me in peace!

193
00:13:41,741 --> 00:13:42,986
Excuse me!

194
00:13:43,010 --> 00:13:44,255
Who spoke?

195
00:13:46,421 --> 00:13:48,287
And who might you be?

196
00:13:48,311 --> 00:13:49,916
My name is Tink.

197
00:13:49,941 --> 00:13:52,660
Tink, you said? And where
on earth did you pop out from?

198
00:13:52,701 --> 00:13:55,600
You know, it's been 12 years
that I've been looking for you!

199
00:13:55,833 --> 00:13:57,336
You are a girl, aren't you?

200
00:14:01,440 --> 00:14:04,021
Yes, tell the truth! I
know that you are a girl.

201
00:14:04,306 --> 00:14:06,261
It's not true, I'm not a girl!

202
00:14:06,285 --> 00:14:07,523
And I tell you that you are!

203
00:14:07,794 --> 00:14:09,621
No, I told you I'm not!

204
00:14:09,646 --> 00:14:10,864
Do you mean to say you're not a female?

205
00:14:11,529 --> 00:14:13,708
Alright, fine. But
how do you know?

206
00:14:13,734 --> 00:14:16,379
Well, you see...
it's just that I...

207
00:14:16,403 --> 00:14:19,497
...was an angel.

208
00:14:19,522 --> 00:14:22,619
I was a real angel,
before becoming a boy.

209
00:14:22,661 --> 00:14:24,219
I came from Heaven

210
00:14:24,261 --> 00:14:26,491
I searched for you a lot
before managing to find you!

211
00:14:26,516 --> 00:14:29,817
I was sent to make you
a sweet girl, you know?

212
00:14:29,842 --> 00:14:32,141
You want to make me
a sweet girl?!

213
00:14:40,457 --> 00:14:43,371
Listen, you can try
if you want

214
00:14:43,396 --> 00:14:45,954
but I'm very much afraid that you
will never succeed!

215
00:14:45,979 --> 00:14:48,101
I, on the other hand, am sure
that I will succeed!

216
00:14:48,101 --> 00:14:48,842
Go away!

217
00:14:51,096 --> 00:14:53,204
We'll see each other again soon!

218
00:14:54,207 --> 00:14:55,517
Your secret is safe with me!

219
00:14:55,542 --> 00:14:57,419


220
00:15:01,421 --> 00:15:03,252


221
00:15:03,301 --> 00:15:06,361
Can you really call yourselves high-class assassins in the service of Lord Nylon?!

222
00:15:06,386 --> 00:15:08,270
Getting knocked into the river by a petty thief like that...

223
00:15:08,295 --> 00:15:10,661
...by that stupid brat?!

224
00:15:10,685 --> 00:15:13,436
Wait, weren't you knocked in too, Lord Nylon?

225
00:15:13,461 --> 00:15:16,180
Silence, idiots!
Did you use the sword

226
00:15:16,221 --> 00:15:20,415
...that sprays that liquid which makes it possible
to tell men from women?

227
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:23,061
We tried, Baron, but that
liquid had no effect.

228
00:15:24,535 --> 00:15:25,861
Oh, look!
The liquid is working!

229
00:15:25,861 --> 00:15:28,091
The Baron has turned blue!

230
00:15:28,140 --> 00:15:31,735
Lord Nylon really is a man!

231
00:15:31,760 --> 00:15:32,760
You bastards!

232
00:15:33,421 --> 00:15:37,016
Good morning, Baron,
I am the alchemist!

233
00:15:37,701 --> 00:15:41,580
Good! I was waiting for you! Have
you brought the drug I asked you for?

234
00:15:42,749 --> 00:15:47,076
So if someone drinks it, they’ll confess the secrets of their heart over and over?!

235
00:15:47,101 --> 00:15:48,501
You, assassins!

236
00:15:48,778 --> 00:15:51,341
This time we will use this
new drug, understood?

237
00:15:52,421 --> 00:15:54,491
Do you want to make the Prince drink it?

238
00:15:54,541 --> 00:15:57,180
- No, to the Queen.
- To the Queen?!

239
00:15:57,221 --> 00:15:59,132
Yes, exactly! You will
give it to the Queen!

240
00:15:59,181 --> 00:16:03,203
The Queen must know the Prince's secret
better than anyone!

241
00:16:03,421 --> 00:16:05,616
With this drug, finally,
the Queen will reveal to us...

242
00:16:05,661 --> 00:16:08,175
..if Sapphire is a girl
or not.

243
00:16:08,421 --> 00:16:11,094
In the meantime, you will lure
Sapphire into the enchanted forest,

244
00:16:11,141 --> 00:16:13,220
where there is a wolf
that feeds on human flesh!

245
00:16:26,941 --> 00:16:29,580
- It's time! Let's split up!
- Good!

246
00:16:30,821 --> 00:16:33,574
Where did they go?
This way or that way? This way? That way?

247
00:16:36,381 --> 00:16:40,294
I don't see them anymore. Who knows where
those three assassins have hidden!

248
00:16:41,213 --> 00:16:43,283
I have the feeling I'm lost.

249
00:16:43,341 --> 00:16:45,935


250
00:16:48,181 --> 00:16:49,660
Who is it?

251
00:16:49,861 --> 00:16:53,251
- It's the Duke, Your Grace.
- Hello, Duke Duralumin.

252
00:16:53,301 --> 00:16:55,576
- Do you desire something?
- A merchant has brought me..

253
00:16:55,621 --> 00:16:57,612
...a very rare elixir.

254
00:16:57,653 --> 00:17:00,636
It is very sweet
and I am sure you will like it.

255
00:17:00,661 --> 00:17:01,575
You are very kind, Duke

256
00:17:02,107 --> 00:17:04,019
- Baron Nylon!
- Yes?

257
00:17:04,068 --> 00:17:06,377
- Would you like to taste some?
- No! Well, actually, I...

258
00:17:06,421 --> 00:17:08,218
...for the last few days
I have become a bit of a teetotaler!

259
00:17:08,261 --> 00:17:10,900
- Nonsense! Just a drop!
- Only a drop...

260
00:17:11,221 --> 00:17:14,258


261
00:17:15,021 --> 00:17:17,707
And now to you, my Queen!

262
00:17:19,661 --> 00:17:21,333
I am truly lost!

263
00:17:21,358 --> 00:17:23,048
And now who knows what
will be the way out of the forest!

264
00:17:24,742 --> 00:17:28,181
It seems to me that
you are lost, young man.

265
00:17:28,181 --> 00:17:31,461
You're right, old woman. Can you
show me which way I should go?

266
00:17:31,461 --> 00:17:34,701
There is a wolf that feeds
on human flesh, in the forest!

267
00:17:34,701 --> 00:17:37,575
Be careful! This wolf has
lived here for 100 years.

268
00:17:37,600 --> 00:17:39,140
...and it is very cunning and fast!

269
00:17:39,165 --> 00:17:41,612
If you go that way,
you'll find a hut...

270
00:17:41,637 --> 00:17:43,324
...where you can take shelter
tonight.

271
00:17:43,821 --> 00:17:45,484
I'll go there! Thank you, old woman!

272
00:18:14,141 --> 00:18:16,450
The drug we put
in the elixir...

273
00:18:16,501 --> 00:18:18,492
...will take effect
within two hours at most.

274
00:18:18,541 --> 00:18:21,294
The Queen will willingly reveal to us
the Prince's secret...

275
00:18:21,341 --> 00:18:23,730
...and she will tell us if he
is actually a girl!

276
00:18:23,883 --> 00:18:26,894
Yes, but you too will reveal
your secrets!

277
00:18:26,941 --> 00:18:28,615
You have also drunk
the drugged elixir!

278
00:18:44,481 --> 00:18:45,870
There is so much dust
in this hut!

279
00:18:48,021 --> 00:18:51,215
These are the wolf's tracks!
My goodness, he must be huge!

280
00:19:01,861 --> 00:19:04,375
But you're Tink!
Do you know you scared me?

281
00:19:04,421 --> 00:19:07,996
Is that how you greet a friend?
I came to warn you...

282
00:19:08,021 --> 00:19:10,339
...that you've been deceived! This
is the hut where the wolf lives!

283
00:19:10,363 --> 00:19:11,437
What are you saying?

284
00:19:11,461 --> 00:19:12,916
Yes! That wolf is so clever

285
00:19:12,941 --> 00:19:16,167
...that he sends travelers to this
hut to devour them later.

286
00:19:16,966 --> 00:19:20,898
See those hats? They belonged
to the people he devoured!

287
00:19:20,941 --> 00:19:22,140
If what you say is true,
then I am lost.

288
00:19:23,741 --> 00:19:27,148
I know that when the wolf realizes
that its prey is a girl, it lets her go.

289
00:19:27,619 --> 00:19:30,407
If you think that for this reason
I'll dress as a girl, you're wrong!

290
00:19:30,432 --> 00:19:32,100
Would you prefer to be devoured?

291
00:19:32,125 --> 00:19:34,421
I will never dress as a girl!

292
00:20:02,341 --> 00:20:05,741
There you go! Sapphire, do you know that you are
really so pretty?

293
00:20:05,765 --> 00:20:07,781
If only you knew how ridiculous I feel!

294
00:20:08,341 --> 00:20:10,340
Remember to behave
like a girl!

295
00:20:10,744 --> 00:20:12,821
I can't wait
to get these rags off me!

296
00:20:14,501 --> 00:20:16,812
The wolf! Here comes the wolf!

297
00:20:18,501 --> 00:20:21,659
Let him get close and strike
him by surprise! Good luck!

298
00:20:34,221 --> 00:20:36,018
Almost there!

299
00:20:36,042 --> 00:20:38,177
I feel a sharp pain!

300
00:20:38,221 --> 00:20:40,496
• Is there something wrong,
my Queen?

301
00:20:40,541 --> 00:20:43,021
I would like to confess a
secret of mine to someone.

302
00:20:47,021 --> 00:20:51,014


303
00:20:52,021 --> 00:20:55,457


304
00:20:56,387 --> 00:20:58,021
It’s Little Red Riding Hood.

305
00:20:58,596 --> 00:21:00,963
Oh my.

306
00:21:01,541 --> 00:21:03,418
Oh! The wolf!

307
00:21:03,901 --> 00:21:06,938
You mustn't be afraid!
And now what do I do?!

308
00:21:07,221 --> 00:21:11,817
There is nothing more disgusting
than a little girl dying of fear.

309
00:21:11,861 --> 00:21:13,394
Hey, do you like flowers?

310
00:21:14,061 --> 00:21:16,291
Would you prefer a piece of cake?

311
00:21:16,341 --> 00:21:20,047
Don't be afraid of me! I
will be so good to you!

312
00:21:20,072 --> 00:21:21,472
And don't tremble! You make me nervous!

313
00:21:21,497 --> 00:21:23,920
What do you want me to do? Stop?

314
00:21:23,945 --> 00:21:26,301
I just need you to become smaller.

315
00:21:28,855 --> 00:21:29,646
Is this okay?

316
00:21:29,671 --> 00:21:30,981
Even smaller?

317
00:21:31,094 --> 00:21:31,981
Fine then.

318
00:21:33,311 --> 00:21:35,311
Like this?

319
00:21:36,570 --> 00:21:37,701
Cute!

320
00:21:37,725 --> 00:21:39,580
I've got you! I will stop you
from doing any more harm!

321
00:21:44,808 --> 00:21:47,253
You tricked me! And it's
over for you, damn little girl!

322
00:21:47,301 --> 00:21:49,860
Now I will kill you!

323
00:21:51,541 --> 00:21:54,692
It hurts!

324
00:22:33,621 --> 00:22:38,331
Fire! Fire!

325
00:22:38,381 --> 00:22:40,501
Help!

326
00:22:40,602 --> 00:22:46,436
Well done, Sapphire! You
did it! You defeated the wolf!

327
00:22:46,461 --> 00:22:49,737
The secret I would like to
confess concerns Sapphire.

328
00:22:49,781 --> 00:22:52,500
Here we go! The Queen is
about to reveal the secret!

329
00:22:52,533 --> 00:22:55,340
Finally I will know
if the Prince is a boy!

330
00:23:03,423 --> 00:23:05,525
I must confess to you
that actually Sapphire is...

331
00:23:05,746 --> 00:23:06,628
Come on!

332
00:23:13,621 --> 00:23:15,327
- Yes, I will say it!

333
00:23:15,351 --> 00:23:16,244
Sapphire - What, Queen?

334
00:23:17,630 --> 00:23:20,330
I too, my Queen, have a
secret to reveal! Yes, yes!

335
00:23:20,381 --> 00:23:22,849
I will tell you: the Grand Duke
has put a drug in the elixir...

336
00:23:22,901 --> 00:23:25,734
...which will force you to reveal if
the Prince is truly a boy!

337
00:23:25,758 --> 00:23:28,955
If you confess that he is not,
the Grand Duke will be able to seize power...

338
00:23:28,980 --> 00:23:30,904
Shut up! You've ruined everything!

339
00:23:34,261 --> 00:23:35,473
What's happening, Baron?

340
00:23:35,498 --> 00:23:38,017
The Queen is about to reveal
whether you are male or female,

341
00:23:38,042 --> 00:23:39,962
because she drank a drug
that the Grand Duke gave her!

342
00:23:39,987 --> 00:23:40,859
What a schemer!

343
00:23:42,741 --> 00:23:43,883
Let's go, Opal!

344
00:23:50,181 --> 00:23:53,161
- What did you do to my mother?
- Nothing special.

345
00:23:53,273 --> 00:23:53,810
Go away!

346
00:23:54,170 --> 00:23:56,461
Forgive the intrusion, my Queen.

347
00:23:57,071 --> 00:24:00,124
Sapphire I was about to reveal your secret!

348
00:24:00,149 --> 00:24:03,796
But we will continue to pretend
that I am a boy,

349
00:24:03,821 --> 00:24:07,610
until there are no more villains
in our kingdom, Mother!

350
00:24:07,635 --> 00:24:08,751
Sapphire!

351
00:24:38,950 --> 00:24:42,570
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

352
00:24:42,571 --> 00:24:45,931
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

353
00:24:45,932 --> 00:24:49,702
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

354
00:24:49,703 --> 00:24:52,864
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

355
00:24:52,865 --> 00:24:56,678
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

356
00:24:56,679 --> 00:24:59,975
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

357
00:24:59,976 --> 00:25:03,981
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

358
00:25:03,982 --> 00:25:07,420
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

359
00:25:07,421 --> 00:25:11,041
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

360
00:25:11,042 --> 00:25:14,402
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

361
